    <p>"I've experienced a lot of emotional trauma throughout my life, and recently some of that older trauma has resurfaced. I turned to Dusti for Emotion Code therapy, and once again, I'm absolutely amazed by her incredible intuition and her ability to guide me into a profound state of healing. She mentioned that it would take about four days for me to release my trapped emotions, and on the third day, I experienced a breakthrough. During a quiet evening, a wave of emotions came flooding out through tears and laughter, and I felt a weight lift that I never imagined possible.</p>

    <p>Dusti is truly one of a kind. I trust her completely to help me navigate my journey of healing and processing, and I will continue to choose her as my guide. She's even worked her magic on my sweet dog, Eleanor, who had been traumatized after getting her tail caught in my car's back hatch. Thanks to Dusti, Eleanor is happily jumping into my Jeep again. Dusti has an incredible gift, and I'm so grateful to have found her!" -M.D., Colorado</p>

